#: otterwiki/templates/snippets/syntax.html:40
msgid ""
"To create paragraphs, use a blank line to separate one or more lines of "
"text. A single newline does <em>not</em> render as a line break: "
"consecutive lines are joined into one paragraph. To force a line break, "
"end a line with two or more spaces or with a backslash <code>\\</code>."
